            "text": "A continuación se muestra la información extraída **literalmente** de la documentación oficial de la API de Docplanner (https://integrations.docplanner.com/docs/):\n\n---\n\n### 1. Rutas de la API relacionadas con huecos libres (`slots`) y reservas (`book` / `bookings`)\n\n#### **Slots**\n* `GET /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/slots`\n* `PUT /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/slots`\n* `POST /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/slots/{start}/book`\n* `DELETE /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/slots`\n\n#### **Bookings**\n* `POST /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/bookings`\n* `GET /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/bookings`\n* `GET /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/bookings/{booking_id}`\n* `DELETE /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/bookings/{booking_id}`\n* `POST /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/bookings/{booking_id}/move`\n* `PUT /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/bookings/{booking_id}/confirm`\n* `PUT /facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/bookings/{booking_id}/request-opinion`\n\n*(Estructura completa de la URL definida en la página: `https://www.{domain}/api/v3/integration/facilities/{facility_id}/doctors/{doctor_id}/addresses/{address_id}/...`)*\n\n---\n\n### 2. Frase que explica de quién son los huecos (`slots`)\n\nEn la sección **Slots** (`getSlots`), la frase literal explicativa es:\n\n\u003e `\"List of free slots for the address within specified date range.\"`\n\n---\n\n### 3. Frases que hablan de calendarios (`calendars`) y a quién pertenecen\n\nEn la sección **Calendars**, las frases literales explicativas son:\n\n\u003e `\"Simple operations on the calendar belonging to the address\"`\n\u003e\n\u003e `\"Gets calendar of the address\"`\n\u003e\n\u003e `\"Enable calendar on the address\"`\n\u003e\n\u003e `\"Disable calendar on the address\"`",
